<title>ITALY: SOCCER-JUVENTUS 1 AJAX 0 - LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-JUVENTUS 1 AJAX 0 - LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>TURIN, Italy 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Juventus of Italy led Ajax</p>
<p>of the Netherlands 1-0 in their European Cup semifinal second</p>
<p>leg on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer - Attilio Lombardo 34</p>
<p>Aggregate score: 3-1 to Juventus</p>
